+function [prog,P] = pos_def(prog,X,side,dom)                                % MMP, 11/13/2026
+% [PROG,P] = POS_DEF(PROG,X,SIDE,DOM) declares the positive operator of     % MMP, 11/13/2026
+% the program settings on the SIDE spaces of X: POSCOPVAR with DEG          % MMP, 11/13/2026
+% omitted, the degrees of prog.settings.lpi.pos space by space (entry       % MMP, 11/13/2026
+% min(d,3) for a space in d variables, POSCOPVAR help); the 2-D storage.    % MMP, 11/13/2026
+% INPUT  prog:  'struct', the LPI program (LPIPROGRAM, with settings);      % MMP, 11/13/2026
+%        X:     'copvar' or 'cdopvar' object;                               % MMP, 11/13/2026
+%        side:  char, 'out' or 'in';                                        % MMP, 11/13/2026
+%        dom:   'struct' with fields vars and dom, the domain of P.         % MMP, 11/13/2026
+% OUTPUT prog:  'struct', the program with the Gram matrices of P;          % MMP, 11/13/2026
+%        P:     'cdopvar' object.                                           % MMP, 11/13/2026
+[sp,dm] = copvar_space_list(X,side);                                        % MMP, 11/13/2026
